OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FLow cloud quickly lifting to
OL,6,Fbrighter skies, with plenty of hazy
OL,7,Fspells of sunshine developing. An
OL,8,Fisolated light shower or two may be
OL,9,Fpossible, mainly during the afternoon.
OL,10,FFeeling warm and muggy, with light
OL,11,Fwinds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FCloud increasing through the
OL,14,Fevening, with a period of heavy rain
OL,15,Fmoving southwards by late evening and
OL,16,Fduring the early hours. Staying cloudy
OL,17,Fand damp thorough until dawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
